:: About [markdown]

**We+ are CQD, Creative Queer Den.** The plus is a lot to explain, but suffice it to say we're roommates in a singular body- [[plurality|https://pluralpedia.org/w/Plurality]] is our+ everyday. We've gone through many names over the years (mainly due to [[primary fronters|https://pluralpedia.org/w/Primary_Fronter]] shifting and changing), going from one identity and name to another before eventually settling on the one we+ have now- Neston Linden Toftwyn, self-imposed Writer, Artist and Modder extraordinaire. We've+ tried to make this game very easy to mod. We+ hope to make a story about finding home, and protecting that feeling and the beings in it with your life. The true ending of this game is one you make for yourself, and I find that beautiful. It's a sandbox, at the fullest. You make the ending, I'll make the world. That's how I hope this will go.

This game does have complicated, sometimes mature themes as well as scenes, and that is something that those who may not be an adult yet may not want to experience. The disclaimer here is this: Skip what you like. Don't feel the need to see or look at something that you'd rather not see. The skip button is there for a good reason, and so are the skip summaries. 
Fair warning: Characters in this game will have their own preferences, just like the player, and that may offend some. I'm not here to say *"yes you can"* to everything the player *wants* to do. **This world is alive...** or it's meant to be written that way, anyway. 

I hope you enjoy playing it as much as we+ did writing it!

{{Back|Start}}